#4600
The UnderWorld~
This area (4601-4808) was written by builder unknown. If you should happen
to know who did write it, please include them in the credits here and in
the area listing. The area is really a collection of areas, inhabited by
Kuo-Toans, Duergar and all manner of subterranean monsters. Equipment here
is oriented towards the warrior and cleric classes for the most part.

Modified by Vex 30/12/95 for RavenMud
~
