~
~
0 0 4606
E
river water~
The river is very cold and crystal clear.  Along with thick humidity, 
the mild odor of subterranean minerals wafts off the water as it flows 
through the cavern.  The river's water is probably cleaner than any
you've seen on the surface world.
~
S
#4602
An Underground River~
   The river's current is less turbulent in this side branch, becoming 
both wider and calmer to the east.  Several large stalagmites rise up 
above the water level here, causing dozens of tiny whirlpools as the 
river flows slowly by.  The purple illuminating fungus has also returned 
in this section of the cavern, clinging to the walls and ceiling high 
above.
~
