#4603
An Underground River~
   The river widens a bit here bulging out to about thirty feet in size,
slowing the river's current even further.  The river flows into a large
cavern to the east, and narrows a bit to the west.  A single, huge 
stalagmite rises out of the river almost the to caverns ceiling here,
with its upper most peak covered in glowing purple fungus.
