from north to south.  The cavern containing the river only reaches up 
about twenty feet above the water line, and continues at this height to 
the south for a considerable distance.  There is a strange smell on the 
air similar to that of small plants or mushrooms.  A large side cavern 
branches off to the east here onto dry land.
