#4624
Mammoth Cavern~
   The height of this immense cavern is stunning, reaching up almost 
beyond the range of sight.  What is more amazing is that thousands of
crystalline formations cover the walls and floor of this entire area, each
looking like a beautiful plant made from tan-colored crystals.  The smell
of subterranean minerals permeates the air, and a cool draft blows in 
from somewhere.  The beauty of this place is awe inspiring, continuing
on in the cavern west of here.
~
