E
crystal formation plant~
The plants are each about five feet in size with thick stubby leaves
of tan-colored minerals sprouting outwards, looking like plants made
from pure crystal.  It must have taken millions of years for such a 
beautiful thing to take form.
~
S
#4625
Mammoth Cavern~
   This great cavern is bit smaller than the one east of here, but no less
stunning.  A huge formation of tan-colored minerals occupies the center
of this place, and must be thirty feet in diameter.  The formation is
simply stunning and very delicate looking, with hundreds of stubby
leaf-like spikes popping outwards from the formation's midsection.
The unimaginable amount of time it must have taken for this crystalline 
tree to form serves as a stern reminder of just how far underground this 
cavern really is, with a beauty that would be hard to match on the surface 
world.  The cavern continues on to the east and west.
~
