ceiling high above.  At the southern end, a large throne sits upon a 
small mithril pedestal.  There is a six foot round circular portal on the
west wall that glows brightly in a green hue.  This is obviously where the 
leader of these people usually resides, making battle or trading plans for 
the duergar people.  The only exit from this chamber is to the north into a 
large hallway.  Several windows in the southern wall give a clear view of 
the duergar complex beyond.
