humans head and large razor sharp mandibles.  The face of the spider 
looks vaguely female, wearing a twisted and evil expression.  A single line 
of text accompanies the spider at the base of the image, written in a very 
ornate language that is definitely NOT common.  The writing is more akin 
to elven in some respects.  Taken as a whole, the image speaks loudly 
that whoever carved these caves either worked for, or were members of, 
the Drow elven race...
