difficult to see anything.  The air in here is thick and intensely hot, 
with small blue bolts of magical energy sparking from wall to wall 
every few seconds.  Because of the brightness, what lies at the end 
of the tunnel cannot be seen.  This is the kind of place that children
have nightmares about, a place that would strike terror into the 
hearts of all but those with godlike gallantry and a will of steel.   
