#4806
Caved-In Tunnel~
   This tunnel at one time split off in three directions, to the north, east,
and south.  The northern branch has totally collapsed, blocking any chance
of travel in that direction.  The huge mound of boulders looks a little too
perfectly arranged however, indicating that the tunnel may have been 
deliberately sealed off for some unknown reason.  The main tunnel continues
back to the south, while a small side branch leads off to the east.
